# Copy this file to .env and uncomment exactly ONE option.
# Check it with:  python check_key.py

# --- Option A: HKU ITS Developer Portal (free, on-campus, no region block) ----
# Students get 500k AI credits per month, shared with the HKU GenAI web app.
# 1. https://developer.hku.hk  -> sign in with your HKU Portal account
# 2. Product catalogue -> "student-genai-services" -> Subscribe (wait for APPROVAL)
# 3. The portal exposes DIFFERENT request shapes per API — match them like this:
#
#    A1. Azure DeepSeek Service API (Students) -> POST /models/chat/completions
#        (OpenAI-compatible; use this for DeepSeek-V4-Flash / DeepSeek-V4-Pro)
#        LLM_BASE_URL = the request URL up to AND including "/models"
#        LLM_MODEL    = the model name, e.g. DeepSeek-V4-Flash
#
#    A2. Vertex AI Gemini Service API (Students) -> POST /{deployment-id}:generateContent
#        LLM_API_STYLE = vertex
#        LLM_BASE_URL  = everything BEFORE "/{deployment-id}:generateContent"
#        LLM_MODEL     = the deployment-id, e.g. gemini-3.5-flash
LLM_API_KEY=your-hku-portal-key
LLM_BASE_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-HOST-PATH-ENDING-IN-/models
LLM_MODEL=DeepSeek-V4-Flash
# LLM_API_STYLE=vertex   # uncomment only for the Gemini API

# --- Option B: DeepSeek (cheapest paid, no daily cap, reachable from HK) ------
# platform.deepseek.com -> top up ~10 RMB -> API keys
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
# LLM_MODEL=deepseek-chat

# --- Option C: OpenRouter (free models, no payment to start) ------------------
# openrouter.ai -> sign in with Google -> Keys -> Create key
# Pick a model whose id ends in ":free" from openrouter.ai/models?max_price=0
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-xxxxxxxxxxxx
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# LLM_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1:free

# --- Option D: Groq (free, fast - the console may be unreachable in HK) -------
# console.groq.com -> API Keys -> Create API Key
# LLM_API_KEY=gsk_...
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# --- Option E: SiliconFlow (free quota on several models) --------------------
# cloud.siliconflow.cn -> API keys
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1
# LLM_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct

# --- Option F: Google Gemini (NOT available in Hong Kong / Macao / mainland China)
# LLM_API_KEY=AIza-your-key-here
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# --- Option G: OpenAI ---------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# NOTE: GitHub Models was retired on 2026-07-30. `https://models.github.ai` no longer
# serves inference, so a GitHub PAT will not work here.
